  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forest deleg May 2003</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skoglig deleg maj 2003</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on, Concept for Development of the Russian Federation Forest Sector 2003-2010, a working group with high officials from various ministries has been formed. A study tour to Sweden, Estonia and Latvia will be conducted on May 10-18 for 15 of these top-level officials, working with questions on sustainable forest management.There will be a Follow-up Seminar in June 2003 in Moscow.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">P&#xe5; basis av, Concept for Development of the Russian Federation Forest Sector 2003-2010, har en arbetsgrupp av h&#xf6;ga tj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;n bildats fr&#xe5;n olika ministerier. En studieresa till Sverige, Estland och Lettland kommer att genomf&#xf6;ras 10-18 maj 2003 f&#xf6;r 15 av dessa tj&#xe4;nstem&#xe4;n, vilka arbetar med fr&#xe5;gor om uth&#xe5;lligt skogsbruk. Ett avslutande seminarium h&#xe5;lls i juni 2003 i Moskva.</narrative>
  </description>
